;
; How Pollen files one offer to nearby devices in MYRA (pollen_rules.h
; PR4): its number, how many files it holds, their bytes in all, its state
; (0 drafted, 1 open on the owner's approval, 2 withdrawn) and when (ms
; since 1970, zxvd's clock).
^ZXPOLLEN(offer:i4) = files:i2! ^ bytes:i9! ^ state:i1! ^ stamp:i15!
